cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or refer to this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "hyperblade-decomp: A Byte-Matching Decompilation of HyperBlade"
abstract: >-
  A byte-matching decompilation of HYPERX.EXE v1.0.0.1, from the 1996 game HyperBlade by WizBang!
  Software Productions for Activision, rebuilt with Visual C++ 6.0 SP3 and scored per function by
  reccmp. It contains no code or data from the original game; you supply your own copy.
authors:
